				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>イヤッホー！▼
兄弟で　一番　強い
オレさまと　遊ぼうぜ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-30T01:59:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
